# Verification selection

Read `docs/agents/verification.md` after source or test edits, including test additions,
renames, deletions and dependency changes. Use its file plan, execution declarations
and repository commands. Root AGENTS.md owns the complete candidate review and
verification order. Keep one policy owner instead of client-specific test lists.
